    "text": "<p>From the rate law:</p><p><math><mtext>log</mtext><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>0.3010</mn><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></math></p><p><math><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><